HAMMOND: Whilst Jamelia
regained her composure,
I checked on the others.

1117
00:54:22,933 --> 00:54:24,267
杰里米，你那边怎么样了？
Jeremy, how are you doing?

1118
00:54:25,267 --> 00:54:26,400
呃……不太妙。
Uh... Not well.

1119
00:54:30,800 --> 00:54:32,100
哈蒙德：车怎么了？
HAMMOND: It's what?

1120
00:54:32,133 --> 00:54:34,000
它在莉莉路上断成两截了。
It's in two pieces
on the Lillie Road.

1121
00:54:35,267 --> 00:54:36,967
它断成两截了。
It's broken in half.

1122
00:54:37,000 --> 00:54:39,867
（大笑）
抱歉我没能
多给你点精神支撑！
(LAUGHS)
I'm sorry not to
be more supportive!

1123
00:54:43,400 --> 00:54:44,900
对不住了，克里斯。
Sorry, Chris.

1124
00:54:49,433 --> 00:54:52,133
照这个速度，
我恐怕得迟到
整整一个小时。
I'm going to be an hour late
or something like that,
at this rate.

1125
00:54:54,900 --> 00:54:56,867
我头一回被提名，
最佳男歌手啊。
First time I'm nominated,
best male.

1126
00:54:56,900 --> 00:54:58,900
最佳男歌手，勒马尔！
Best male, Lemar!

1127
00:54:58,933 --> 00:55:00,267
詹姆斯：先生，在音乐圈里，
JAMES: Surely, sir,
in the music business,

1128
00:55:00,267 --> 00:55:01,500
迟到很久
不是很时髦的吗？
it's fashionable
to be quite late.

1129
00:55:01,533 --> 00:55:03,767
不管是哪位大牌，
都没人会准时到场的。
Anybody, nobody
ever turns up on time.

1130
00:55:03,800 --> 00:55:06,067
时髦的晚到是一回事，
蠢到家的大迟到是另一回事！
There's fashionably late
and there's stupidly late.

1131
00:55:06,100 --> 00:55:08,000
我只能深表歉意了，先生，
但这……
I can only apologise, sir,
but it's...

1132
00:55:08,033 --> 00:55:10,267
我什么都不想听！
拜托你，
I don't want to hear anything!
Just please,

1133
00:55:10,267 --> 00:55:12,067
只要把我送到就行。
just get me there.

1134
00:55:12,100 --> 00:55:15,267
好啦，
还剩最后五分钟。
Well, there's
five minutes to go.

1135
00:55:15,300 --> 00:55:17,500
梅已经彻底迷路了。
May's hopelessly lost.

1136
00:55:17,533 --> 00:55:19,700
杰里米的车断成了两半。
Jeremy's car is split in half.

1137
00:55:19,733 --> 00:55:22,133
这意味着，
就算纯属侥幸捡漏，
That means,
by default if nothing else,

1138
00:55:22,167 --> 00:55:24,267
赢家也是我了！耶！
I am the winner! Yah!

1139
00:55:26,167 --> 00:55:27,767
杰里米：哈蒙德或许得意洋洋，
JEREMY: Hammond may
have been gloating,

1140
00:55:28,967 --> 00:55:31,633
但我可还没出局呢！
but I wasn't out of
the competition yet!

1141
00:55:32,567 --> 00:55:34,333
（摇滚乐响起）
(ROCK MUSIC PLAYING)

1142
00:55:49,333 --> 00:55:51,333
颁奖典礼几点开始？
What time do the awards start?

1143
00:55:52,133 --> 00:55:53,300
大概还有五分钟。
About five minutes.

1144
00:56:05,267 --> 00:56:08,100
（音频刺耳啸叫）
(FEEDBACK SCREECHES)

1145
00:56:08,133 --> 00:56:09,867
到地儿了，熄火。
That's here, end it.

1146
00:56:13,467 --> 00:56:14,900
噢！等等，等等，等等。
Oh! Wait, wait, wait.

1147
00:56:14,933 --> 00:56:18,033
-要体面，优雅登场。
-体面，没错。体面。
-Dignity, you arrive in.
-Dignity, yeah. Dignity.

1148
00:56:18,900 --> 00:56:20,267
红地毯就在那边。
The red carpet's over there.

1149
00:56:21,933 --> 00:56:25,333
总之莫伊尔斯挺高兴，
哈蒙德可气炸了。
So, Moyles was happy,
but Hammond wasn't.

1150
00:56:25,367 --> 00:56:29,100
你作弊！你只剩半截车到的！
你本来应该开着整……
You cheated! You finished
with half a car.
You're supposed to finish...

1151
00:56:29,133 --> 00:56:31,600
这照样算加长车！
反正我把人给送到了。
It's still a stretch!
I got the man here.

1152
00:56:32,933 --> 00:56:36,267
与此同时，在某辆
离伯爵宫十万八千里的车里，
Meanwhile, in a car somewhere
nowhere near Earls Court,

1153
00:56:36,267 --> 00:56:37,833
被公认为
Lemar, acknowledged
as one of the

1154
00:56:37,867 --> 00:56:41,033
流行乐坛好好先生的勒马尔，
也彻底忍无可忍了。
gentlemen of pop,
had had enough.

1155
00:56:41,067 --> 00:56:42,967
严格来说该往左拐，
但我觉得要是往右走，
Strictly speaking it's left,
but I think if we go right,

1156
00:56:43,767 --> 00:56:45,100
我就能从后边绕过去。
I can go round the back.

1157
00:56:45,133 --> 00:56:47,833
-往右走是什么意思？
-这个嘛……
-What d'you mean, right?
-Well...

1158
00:56:47,867 --> 00:56:49,167
往右？凭什么？
你刚刚明明说……
Right. Why?
You've just said...

1159
00:56:49,267 --> 00:56:51,533
不，你听着。
你刚才说往左拐，对吧？
No, listen.
You just said, go left. Right?

1160
00:56:51,567 --> 00:56:53,267
哎，大多数人确实会
往左拐，先生。
Well, most people would
go left, sir.

1161
00:56:53,267 --> 00:56:55,900
那我们干嘛不
跟着大多数人的路线走？
So why don't we
just follow what
most people do?

1162
00:56:55,933 --> 00:56:57,633
因为我觉得
如果我们往右拐……
Because I think
if we go right...

1163
00:56:57,667 --> 00:56:58,967
你现在是成心的是吧？
Are you doing this
intentionally now?

1164
00:56:59,000 --> 00:57:01,167
这简直……（结巴）
这也太蠢了。
It's actually... (STAMMERS)
This is just stupid.

1165
00:57:01,267 --> 00:57:02,400
你脑子有毛病吧？
Are you a jerk?

1166
00:57:02,433 --> 00:57:04,433
-没啊，但……
-你是专门来给我添堵的吗？
-No, but...
-Have you come to
mess up my day?

1167
00:57:04,467 --> 00:57:07,467
你把我接上车，
带着我在伦敦城里兜了一圈又一圈，
You've picked me up,
you've driven me round and
round in circles in London,

1168
00:57:07,500 --> 00:57:10,600
哈罗德百货你都路过了
十一次还是一百次了！
you've passed
Harrods 11 or a 100
times now!

1169
00:57:10,633 --> 00:57:12,267
明明该往左，你非让我往右。
It's left, you're telling
me to go right.

1170
00:57:12,300 --> 00:57:14,267
我受够了。
把这该死的车门打开！
我要下车。
I can't take this any more.
Open this damn door!
I want out.

1171
00:57:16,267 --> 00:57:19,633
破烂车门……我受够了。
拉倒吧！
Stupid door... I've had it.
Forget it!

1172
00:57:19,667 --> 00:57:21,367
-（摔门声）
-（金属叮当散落声）
-(DOOR SLAMS)
-(METAL TINKLES)

1173
00:57:31,433 --> 00:57:33,333
Lemar才跟他待了半天就成那样了。
Lemar got like that with him
after half a day.

1174
00:57:33,367 --> 00:57:35,600
-我们可是天天都得跟他共事。
-谁说不是呢。
-We have to work with him
all the time.
-I know.

1175
00:57:35,633 --> 00:57:37,733
不管怎么说，显然是我赢了。
Anyway, clearly I won.

1176
00:57:37,767 --> 00:57:39,300
等等，你先打住。
No, hang on a minute.

1177
00:57:39,333 --> 00:57:42,500
比赛比的是看谁能让自己车上的名人
The competition was to see who
could get the most photographs

1178
00:57:42,533 --> 00:57:45,267
在报纸和杂志上
拿到最多的版面照片。
of their celebrity in
newspapers and magazines.

1179
00:57:45,300 --> 00:57:47,400
我知道这问了也是白问，
Now, I know this is the most
pointless question ever,

1180
00:57:47,433 --> 00:57:49,033
毕竟你最后都迷路到诺维奇去了，
since you ended up in Norwich,

1181
00:57:49,067 --> 00:57:50,467
-你有几张？
-啊！
-how many?
-Ah!

1182
00:57:50,500 --> 00:57:52,133
-一张没有。
-压根没有。
-None.
-None at all.

1183
00:57:52,167 --> 00:57:53,800
-你呢？
-零张。
-And you?
-None.

1184
00:57:53,833 --> 00:57:56,367
你别告诉我哪儿还真登了
克里斯·莫伊尔斯（Chris Moyles）的照片？
Don't tell me there was
a picture of Chris Moyles
somewhere?

1185
00:57:56,400 --> 00:57:58,500
当当！
Ta-da!

1186
00:57:58,533 --> 00:58:01,067
看看这个。认输哭去吧，就在这儿！
Look at that. Read it
and weep. There it is!

1187
00:58:01,100 --> 00:58:04,333
等会儿！
那是在你供稿的报纸上，
你自己的专栏版面！
Well, Hang on!
That's your page,
in your newspaper!

1188
00:58:04,367 --> 00:58:05,600
（观众大笑）
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

1189
00:58:05,633 --> 00:58:07,567
-是啊。
-那你这是作弊！
-Yes.
-Well, you cheated.

1190
00:58:07,600 --> 00:58:09,467
拜托，你们俩不也都有报纸专栏。
Well, you two both have got
newspaper columns.

1191
00:58:09,500 --> 00:58:11,267
你们本来也能这么干，
纯粹是自己没长脑子。
You could have done it.
You just didn't think.

1192
00:58:11,300 --> 00:58:13,533
得了吧，杰里米，
你总不能就凭
Come on, Jeremy,
you can't claim you've won

1193
00:58:13,567 --> 00:58:15,933
那张巴掌大的护照相，
就宣称自己赢了吧。
just because of
that passport picture.

1194
00:58:15,967 --> 00:58:17,600
怎么不能，赢了就是赢了。
Yes, I can. It's the winner.

1195
00:58:17,633 --> 00:58:21,000
可你把东伦敦所有的防撞柱都撞了一遍。
But you hit every
single bollard in East London.

1196
00:58:21,033 --> 00:58:23,133
-是西伦敦，詹姆斯。
-西伦敦，管它呢。
-West, James.
-West, whatever.

1197
00:58:23,167 --> 00:58:26,733
-而且你开到终点时车只剩半截了！
-你自己整个人也就半截高。
-And then you
finish with half a car!
-You're half a person.

1198
00:58:26,767 --> 00:58:27,967
（观众大笑）
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

1199
00:58:28,000 --> 00:58:29,100
我看你倒是一点也不在乎。总之，
Doesn't seem to bother you.
Anyway,

1200
00:58:29,133 --> 00:58:31,000
各位兄弟，这次恐怕确实是我赢了。
I'm afraid I did win that,
chaps.

1201
00:58:31,033 --> 00:58:33,200
伴随着这枚重磅炸弹，
本期节目就要结束了
And on that bombshell,
it's time to end the show

1202
00:58:33,233 --> 00:58:35,167
准确地说，是整季节目就此收官。
and indeed the series.

1203
00:58:36,200 --> 00:58:37,800
我们自己都不知道
什么时候才会回来。
We've no idea
when we'll be back.

1204
00:58:37,833 --> 00:58:39,233
不过我可以透露一点。
I tell you something though.

1205
00:58:39,267 --> 00:58:42,300
我们仨还会回到这里
录制一期特别节目——
The three of us will be back
here to record a special

1206
00:58:42,333 --> 00:58:45,133
为“喜剧救济”慈善日打造的
《Top Gear 流行之巅》，
Top Gear Of The Pops
for Comic Relief

1207
00:58:45,167 --> 00:58:47,367
就在两周之后。
期待到时与大家再会。
in a couple of weeks.
So we hope to see you then.

1208
00:58:47,400 --> 00:58:49,367
非常感谢大家的收看。
晚安！
Thank you very much
for watching. Good night!

